$cssColumnChild[


["It's not a problem. We're all colleagues here, after all,"]<VehVehLine| she smiles, the genuineness of which strikes you, moreso because technically, you, a journeyman, are her superior. And yet, it is //her// who grants you the permission to practice your craft.
<br>
Veh-Veh could have lorded it over you, had she wanted to. That's how it would have gone down in your university.
<br>
["So... anything else?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
